"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">Silver</a>:</b> A complex process involving metallurgy and alchemy can bond <b>silver</b> to a <u>weapon made of steel</u> so that it bypasses the damage reduction of creatures such as devils and vampires. <br /> Silver weapons have 2 points lower hardness then equivalent steel weapons, and as such aren't quite as durable.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0003207500</span>3,207<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">3 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Church_and_the_Cult\" title=\"The Church and the Cult\">The Church and the Cult</a></b>, End Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Holy\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Holy</a>:</b> A holy weapon is imbued with holy power. This power makes the weapon good-aligned. Evil characters wielding this weapon suffer a negative level. The weapon deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all targets of <a href=\"/page/Evil\" title=\"Evil\">evil</a> alignment.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment red\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Red Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Silver_Longbow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Silver_Longbow.png/420px-Silver_Longbow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"464\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Silver_Longbow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This longbow was enchanted for Church of the Silver Flame to give to warriors that had distinguished themselves in combat against Evil. Arrows fired from this bow seek the most vulnerable locations to strike.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Important notes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Compared to other ML8 <a href=\"/page/Longbow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Longbow\">longbows</a>, this bow has increased base weapon damage [1d10], and an increased <a href=\"/page/Critical_threat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical threat\">critical threat</a> range (19-20/x3) that stacks with <a href=\"/page/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical</a>: Piercing.</li>\n<li>Although this bow is made of silver (the material), it does not have the \"<a href=\"/page/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">Silver</a>\" damage type, and does not bypass <a href=\"/page/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>/Silver on foes such as <a href=\"/page/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampires</a>. (As for all bows, you can overcome this deficiency by using silver ammunition.)</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817225917\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3299/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27263/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6718/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n119.93%  143.368     43 Template:IO\n100.00%  119.540      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  119.540      1 -total\n 97.31%  116.321      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 43.72%   52.259      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 42.31%   50.574      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.57%   46.109      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.54%   44.870      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.49%   20.904      6 Template:Popup\n 17.24%   20.613      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:5325-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817225917 and revision id 634786. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Weapon\n  | name                     = Silver Longbow\n  | type                     = Long Bow\n  | hand                     = Ranged\n  | class                    = Ranged\n  | prof                     = Martial\n  | minlevel                 = 8\n  | reqtrait                 = \n  | UMD DC                   = \n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoE}}\n  | damage                   = [1d10] + 3 Pierce, Good, Magic\n  | crit                     = 19-20 / x3\n  | attackmod                = DEX\n  | damagemod                = DEX\n  | durability               = 160\n  | material                 = Silver\n  | hardness                 = 16\n  | basevalue                = 3,207pp 5gp\n  | weight                   = 3 lbs\n  | quest                    = The Church and the Cult\n  | chest                    = End Chest\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Enhancement bonus|w|3}}\n* {{Holy}}\n* {{Augment|Red}}\n  | description              = This longbow was enchanted for Church of the Silver Flame to give to warriors that had distinguished themselves in combat against Evil. Arrows fired from this bow seek the most vulnerable locations to strike.\n  | pic                      = Silver Longbow shown.jpg\n  | picdesc                  = Silver Longbow.png\n  | tips                     = \nImportant notes:\n* Compared to other ML8 [[longbow]]s, this bow has increased base weapon damage [1d10], and an increased [[critical threat]] range (19-20/x3) that stacks with [[Improved Critical]]: Piercing.\n* Although this bow is made of silver (the material), it does not have the \"[[Silver]]\" damage type, and does not bypass [[DR]]/Silver on foes such as [[Vampire]]s. (As for all bows, you can overcome this deficiency by using silver ammunition.)\n}}",
